> [Attributes] of[ ultr]astability[ as] an adaption mechanism in a hormone-modulated neural[ robot] controller were investigated in a simulation. Action[-]selection[ based on] hormone-driven utilities of memory items was used to alternate between[ resource] gathering[ and] recharging tasks.
